{"data": [{"author_id": "45483286", "created_at": "2026-10-23T01:30:11.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2113442830136074622"], "id": "2113442830136074622", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 16, "impression_count": 10255, "like_count": 75, "quote_count": 5, "reply_count": 4, "retweet_count": 12}, "text": "TSMC is looking at North Texas as a possible 2nd fab site in the US due to its vast tracts of lower-cost land where TSMC can build multiple mega-factories over the next decade, media report, as well as direct power grid access and mature semiconductor industry hubs nearby in", "url": "https://x.com/dnystedt/status/2113442830136074622"}, {"attachments": {"media_keys": ["3_2113437761537540096"]}, "author_id": "84679163", "created_at": "2026-10-23T01:10:03.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2113437763810824456"], "entities": {"urls": [{"description": "Global Critical Minerals Outlook 2026 - Analysis and key findings. A report by the International Energy Agency.", "display_url": "iea.li/4vIhhiU", "end": 244, "expanded_url": "https://iea.li/4vIhhiU", "images": [{"height": 600, "url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/news_img/2113437815140716544/mSzCRjRZ?format=jpg&name=orig", "width": 1200}, {"height": 150, "url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/news_img/2113437815140716544/mSzCRjRZ?format=jpg&name=150x150", "width": 150}], "start": 221, "status": 200, "title": "Executive summary - Global Critical Minerals Outlook 2026 - IEA", "unwound_url": "https://www.iea.org/reports/global-critical-minerals-outlook-2026/executive-summary?utm_content=buffer4fedc&utm_medium=social&utm_source=twitter.com&utm_campaign=buffer#abstract", "url": "https://t.co/YSMAbft7NP"}, {"display_url": "pic.x.com/rTzFbJQaio", "end": 268, "expanded_url": "https://x.com/IEA/status/2113437763810824456/photo/1", "media_key": "3_2113437761537540096", "start": 245, "url": "https://t.co/rTzFbJQaio"}]}, "id": "2113437763810824456", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 3, "impression_count": 3162, "like_count": 24, "quote_count": 2, "reply_count": 5, "retweet_count": 8}, "text": "Governments are taking more active roles in supporting the expansion and diversification of critical mineral supplies.\n\nPublic finance commitments more than quadrupled between 2023 and 2025, reaching $65 billion.\n\nMore → https://t.co/YSMAbft7NP https://t.co/rTzFbJQaio", "url": "https://x.com/IEA/status/2113437763810824456"}, {"author_id": "4939401", "created_at": "2026-10-23T00:50:18.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2113432794571641156"], "entities": {"mentions": [{"end": 22, "id": "1455964430760431622", "start": 9, "username": "arcinstitute"}], "urls": [{"display_url": "x.com/pdhsu/status/2…", "end": 304, "expanded_url": "https://twitter.com/pdhsu/status/2113395639224770872", "start": 281, "url": "https://t.co/6a8ZVYsDiC"}]}, "id": "2113432794571641156", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 256, "impression_count": 52510, "like_count": 566, "quote_count": 1, "reply_count": 24, "retweet_count": 45}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2113395639224770872", "type": "quoted"}], "text": "New from @arcinstitute: using the latent space representation of genomes from single-cell life to find new candidate functional RNAs.\n\nI think this is cool because: (1) it uses deep learning and model interpretability to productive ends on a totally different kind of \"knowledge\"; https://t.co/6a8ZVYsDiC", "url": "https://x.com/patrickc/status/2113432794571641156"}, {"author_id": "17468569", "created_at": "2026-10-22T22:56:00.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2113404028407390313"], "id": "2113404028407390313", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 948, "impression_count": 155392, "like_count": 4723, "quote_count": 24, "reply_count": 109, "retweet_count": 218}, "text": "lower resting heart rate -&gt; better sleep\ndeeper sleep -&gt; more energy \nhigher energy -&gt; exercise \nworkouts -&gt; eating well \ngood nutrition -&gt; lower resting heart rate", "url": "https://x.com/bryan_johnson/status/2113404028407390313"}, {"author_id": "17468569", "created_at": "2026-10-22T21:41:38.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2113385315801199010"], "id": "2113385315801199010", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 1157, "impression_count": 325871, "like_count": 5714, "quote_count": 60, "reply_count": 319, "retweet_count": 242}, "text": "Take earplugs everywhere\n\nEnvironments routinely above 85 dBA\n&gt; restaurants\n&gt; sporting events\n&gt; social gatherings \n&gt; gym and theater \n&gt; trains and subways \n&gt; coffee shops \n\nCan't currently fix hearing loss. \n\nHearing loss accelerates brain volume loss and cognitive decline.", "url": "https://x.com/bryan_johnson/status/2113385315801199010"}, {"attachments": {"media_keys": ["3_2113371075518042112"]}, "author_id": "84679163", "created_at": "2026-10-22T20:45:04.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2113371077908783449"], "entities": {"urls": [{"description": "Clean Cooking in Africa 2026 - Analysis and key findings. A report by the International Energy Agency.", "display_url": "iea.li/3U1hT64", "end": 278, "expanded_url": "https://iea.li/3U1hT64", "images": [{"height": 600, "url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/news_img/2112189694331011073/VYOax8J3?format=jpg&name=orig", "width": 1200}, {"height": 150, "url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/news_img/2112189694331011073/VYOax8J3?format=jpg&name=150x150", "width": 150}], "start": 255, "status": 200, "title": "Executive summary - Clean Cooking in Africa 2026 - IEA", "unwound_url": "https://www.iea.org/reports/clean-cooking-in-africa-2026/executive-summary?utm_content=buffer1abb3&utm_medium=social&utm_source=twitter.com&utm_campaign=buffer", "url": "https://t.co/vDxOW5d1Kj"}, {"display_url": "pic.x.com/nfwyNjpiKd", "end": 302, "expanded_url": "https://x.com/IEA/status/2113371077908783449/photo/1", "media_key": "3_2113371075518042112", "start": 279, "url": "https://t.co/nfwyNjpiKd"}]}, "id": "2113371077908783449", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 2, "impression_count": 2521, "like_count": 11, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 4}, "text": "Clean cooking progress is accelerating across Africa. Nearly 12 million people gained access in 2024 – around 3X the annual rate achieved in 2010.\n\nWhile population growth still outpaced progress, efforts to expand access are beginning to close the gap 👉 https://t.co/vDxOW5d1Kj https://t.co/nfwyNjpiKd", "url": "https://x.com/IEA/status/2113371077908783449"}, {"attachments": {"media_keys": ["3_2113363811172532224"]}, "author_id": "1455964430760431622", "created_at": "2026-10-22T20:23:57.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2113365767052042615"], "entities": {"mentions": [{"end": 115, "id": "24828810", "start": 109, "username": "pdhsu"}], "urls": [{"display_url": "pic.x.com/mpC2OG8YyA", "end": 264, "expanded_url": "https://x.com/arcinstitute/status/2113365767052042615/photo/1", "media_key": "3_2113363811172532224", "start": 241, "url": "https://t.co/mpC2OG8YyA"}]}, "id": "2113365767052042615", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 78, "impression_count": 27908, "like_count": 150, "quote_count": 6, "reply_count": 9, "retweet_count": 26}, "text": "Much of the functional biology encoded in genomes remains hidden in noncoding DNA.\n\nIn a preprint out today, @pdhsu and team introduce COMPASS, a genomic language model-based approach to systematically map this underexplored sequence space. https://t.co/mpC2OG8YyA", "url": "https://x.com/arcinstitute/status/2113365767052042615"}, {"attachments": {"media_keys": ["3_2113349688459948032"]}, "author_id": "325581008", "created_at": "2026-10-22T19:20:05.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2113349691433767223"], "entities": {"hashtags": [{"end": 8, "start": 0, "tag": "NRCNews"}], "mentions": [{"end": 97, "id": "166252256", "start": 90, "username": "ENERGY"}, {"end": 111, "id": "66369181", "start": 101, "username": "DeptofWar"}], "urls": [{"display_url": "nrc.gov/about-nrc/news…", "end": 170, "expanded_url": "https://www.nrc.gov/about-nrc/news-releases/2026/26-081", "start": 147, "status": 403, 