: 5871, "like_count": 94, "quote_count": 3, "reply_count": 8, "retweet_count": 24}, "text": "ICYMI: The Energy Department announced Defense Production Act funding for a natural gas pipeline that is critical to America’s national security! 🇺🇸 https://t.co/XVjgJkmnj6", "url": "https://x.com/ENERGY/status/2113300626536878423"}, {"attachments": {"media_keys": ["3_2113284565439492096"]}, "author_id": "3169963433", "created_at": "2026-10-22T15:01:18.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2113284568803394025"], "entities": {"urls": [{"display_url": "pic.x.com/IGNdAyge2T", "end": 304, "expanded_url": "https://x.com/OurWorldInData/status/2113284568803394025/photo/1", "media_key": "3_2113284565439492096", "start": 281, "url": "https://t.co/IGNdAyge2T"}]}, "id": "2113284568803394025", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 43, "impression_count": 10260, "like_count": 170, "quote_count": 7, "reply_count": 4, "retweet_count": 59}, "text": "No matter what poverty line you choose, the share of the global population below it has declined.\n\nThe World Bank's International Poverty Line is an extremely low poverty line. Set at $3 per day, it draws attention to the living conditions of the poorest people on the planet.\n\nIn https://t.co/IGNdAyge2T", "url": "https://x.com/OurWorldInData/status/2113284568803394025"}, {"attachments": {"media_keys": ["3_2113282376059006976"]}, "author_id": "19386622", "created_at": "2026-10-22T14:52:53.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2113282450935722243"], "entities": {"urls": [{"display_url": "pic.x.com/5iB0KHy5GS", "end": 304, "expanded_url": "https://x.com/iaeaorg/status/2113282450935722243/photo/1", "media_key": "3_2113282376059006976", "start": 281, "url": "https://t.co/5iB0KHy5GS"}]}, "id": "2113282450935722243", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 4, "impression_count": 4351, "like_count": 27, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 1, "retweet_count": 6}, "text": "An IAEA team of experts found that Kenya is committed to continuous improvement of the safe 